  "content": "<p style=\"text-align:left\"><img src=\"https://i.imgur.com/TQMpf8h.gif\" alt=\"鉤爪展示\"></p><p style=\"text-align:center\">&nbsp;</p><p style=\"text-align:center\">&nbsp;</p><p style=\"text-align:center\"><span style=\"font-family:'book antiqua', palatino, serif\"><img src=\"http://i.imgur.com/UvWAKaF.png\" alt=\"\" width=\"925\" height=\"490\"></span></p><p style=\"text-align:center\">&nbsp;</p><p style=\"text-align:center\"><span style=\"font-family:'book antiqua', palatino, serif\">&nbsp;</span></p><p style=\"text-align:left\"><span style=\"font-size:24px;font-family:'book antiqua', palatino, serif\"><strong>合成配方：</strong></span></p><p style=\"text-align:center\"><span style=\"font-family:'book antiqua', palatino, serif\"><img src=\"http://i.imgur.com/6Z9xO8L.png\" alt=\"\" width=\"701\" height=\"1192\"></span></p><p style=\"text-align:center\">&nbsp;</p><p style=\"text-align:left\"><span style=\"font-family:'book antiqua', palatino, serif\">&nbsp;<span style=\"font-size:24px\"><strong>附魔：</strong></span></span></p><p style=\"text-align:left\"><span style=\"font-size:18px\"><strong><span style=\"font-family:'book antiqua', palatino, serif\">鉤爪可以附魔，可能的附魔效果如下：&nbsp;</span></strong></span></p><ul>\n<li><span style=\"font-size:14px\">掛鉤速度（I - III）：加快鉤爪的發射速度，同時也增加拉回速度。</span></li>\n<li><span style=\"font-size:14px\">繩索長度（I - III）：增加繩索長度（即鉤爪可達到的最遠距離）。</span></li>\n</ul><p style=\"text-align:left\"><span style=\"font-family:'book antiqua', palatino, serif\"><span style=\"font-size:24px\"><strong>設定選項：&nbsp;</strong></span></span></p><p style=\"text-align:left\"><span style=\"font-family:'book antiqua', palatino, serif;font-size:18px\"><strong>有多種設定選項：</strong></span></p><ul>\n<li style=\"text-align:left\"><span style=\"font-family:'book antiqua', palatino, serif;font-size:18px\"><strong><span style=\"font-size:14px\">是否允許鉤取實體？</span></strong></span></li>\n<li style=\"text-align:left\"><span style=\"font-family:'book antiqua', palatino, serif;font-size:18px\"><strong><span style=\"font-size:14px\">是否允許鉤取玩家？</span></strong></span></li>\n<li style=\"text-align:left\"><span style=\"font-family:'book antiqua', palatino, serif;font-size:18px\"><strong><span style=\"font-size:14px\">是否啟用更真實的鉤取機制？若啟用，玩家撞牆時會受傷，且會受到真實的墜落傷害。</span></strong></span></li>\n</ul><p style=\"text-align:left\">&nbsp;</p><p style=\"text-align:left\"><strong><span style=\"font-family:'book antiqua', palatino, serif;font-size:36px\"><span style=\"font-family:'book antiqua', palatino, serif\"><strong>依賴項目</strong></span></span><span style=\"font-family:'book antiqua', palatino, serif\"><strong style=\"font-family:'book antiqua', palatino, serif;font-size:24px\">：</strong></span></strong></p><p style=\"text-align:left\"><span style=\"font-size:18px\"><strong><span style=\"font-family:'book antiqua', palatino, serif\">此模組依賴於 Kotlin，因此您需要安裝 Kotlin 函式庫模組，請透過<a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/kotlin-libraries\" rel=\"nofollow\">此連結</a>下載。</span></strong></span></p><p style=\"text-align:left\">&nbsp;</p><p style=\"text-align:left\"><span style=\"font-size:36px\"><strong>故障排除</strong>：</span></p><ul>\n<li style=\"text-align:left\"><span style=\"font-size:14px\">我的 Minecraft 在啟動時崩潰：請確認您已安裝<a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/kotlin-libraries\" rel=\"nofollow\">Kotlin 執行環境模組</a>。</span></li>\n</ul><p style=\"text-align:left\">&nbsp;</p><p style=\"text-align:left\"><span style=\"font-family:'book antiqua', palatino, serif\"><span style=\"font-size:24px\"><strong>模組包等：</strong></span></span></p><p style=\"text-align:left\"><span style=\"font-size:18px;font-family:'book antiqua', palatino, serif\"><strong>您可以將此模組加入您的模組包中。</strong></span></p>",
  "contentType": "text/html",
  "type": "curseforge"
}
